<title>BELGIUM: Generale Bank to become DTB member.</title>
<headline>Generale Bank to become DTB member.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1997-06-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Belgian bank Generale Bank will become the first member of the German derivatives bourse DTB, the bank said in a statement on Thursday.</p>
<p>It will have direct access to the bourse as a broker.</p>
<p>DTB is the main European derivatives bourse after London, it said.</p>
<p>&quot;The access to DTB will allow the bank to be present in Frankfurt, which, in a future European monetary market, will become the main bourse for fixed-income securities,&quot; it said.</p>
<p>-- Brussels Newsroom +32 2 287 6810, Fax +32 2 230 7710</p>
